  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLooking for a family home with extra space, flexibility and a touch of coastal living? Set on a generous 812sqm freehold section in Red Beach, this five-bedroom home offers lovely sea views, a versatile layout and fantastic outdoor entertaining areas.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Well-separated 2 bedrooms and bathroom, ideal for extended family or guests\r\n• Near-new modern kitchen with open-plan dining and living area\r\n• Sunny separate lounge, perfect for relaxing and spending time with family\r\n• Spacious, sunny front deck with stunning sea views\r\n• Expansive, private rear deck with louvres and an outdoor fireplace, perfect for relaxing or entertaining all year round\r\n• Generous front lawn with plenty of outdoor space\r\n• Ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles, with room for a boat\r\n• Generous under-house storage\r\n• Within walking distance of beautiful Red Beach, with local schools, shops nearby\r\n\r\nWith so much space inside and out, this home offers a wonderful setting for family life, weekend gatherings and relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nCome and see what this property has to offer! Contact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit our open homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
